Z||000013||California Kid||12-01-2001||11:34 PM||||I can't believe you went over there and acted the way you did!! And said the things you said!! Who the heck has a stock V6 runnings 12's??? Do you think anyone is going to believe that?<P>I sincerely hope enough of the Corvette Forum guys check this site out, just to see were not all jerks!!<P>I spent the evening with about 18 Michigan Member of the Corvette Forum just before Thanksgiving and they even posted pictures of my car on their site. They are good people, they just don't like some kid coming in that can't control himself.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/californiakidsig_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
