Z||000025||96VegasVette||12-02-2001||12:27 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Galen:<BR><B>No offence to vette owners intended here(or maybe there is some, you decide), I am merely stating my opinion. I am sure there are some perfectly nice vette owners, as some of the fiero owners on this forum own vettes. Very, very few vette owners will get any type of respect from me, whether it be on the road, off the road or on a forum. I believe that most are ignorant asses who believe just becuz they own a vette that they are gods gifts to the road who own the roads. <P>Any vette owners on this forum who wish to disagree with anything I have said, or wish to further conversate with me on this subject, msg me on AIM and I'll be glad to talk to you. Fiero88cpe   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Yes I own a Fiero, no I dont give a damn what you think about my car, and YES I love my car   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>While I don't think the majority of Vette owners are "ignorant asses" I will agree that we have our fair share just like everyone else. And some do think the "Vette" is the holy grail (spelling?) of automobiles, which it isn't of course. Although I do happen to like them allot and consider them to be one of the best performing cars for the dollar in stock trim. But overall, most of us are just guys and gals that happen to like this particular kind of car just as you like your Fiero's. Sometimes pissing contest are fun and people's ego's get the best of them. In the end it's all pretty harmless in my opinoin. Like I stated to the guy that started all of this today. Opinions are like assholes, everyone has one and most of them stink, who cares what others think about your car as long as you like it. I rephrased the end a little bit to be a little more Politically correct since I am posting on a Fiero board right now and don't want to get flamed to death.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> You all seem pretty cool to me.<P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.corvetteforum.net/c4/89vegasvette/" TARGET=_blank>          <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.net/c4/89vegasvette/PersonalPics/VegasVetteNewBanner.gif">          </A>||||reg||1
