Z||000067||Oreif||12-02-2001||09:25 AM||||If someone from another forum came here and said the same thing you did on the 'vette forum, They would have gotten the same response. I just think that if someone wants to visit another forum, don't start your first post with a "loaded" question. As for corvettes, I've always like the late 50's and early 60's. Not much of a fan of the 68 thru 80's. The newer ones look good. The biggest thing I am glad about Corvettes is that the person who designed the tail lights on the new Impala's and Monte Carlo's didn't touch the 'vette. <P>BTW ~ Since we have a few Corvette folks here now, Is it true that on the Z06 cars, the red hash marks are put on to harass Ferrari? The rumor is the Z06 car won the race but "rubbed a little paint" with a ferrari and the hash marks represent it.<P>------------------<BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">           <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT>||||reg||2
Z||000068||LoW_KeY||12-02-2001||09:44 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B>And all this happened while I was asleep?  <P>I'll tell you guys a little secret. I like Corvettes. I mean, I like them a lot. Of course I like Fieros much better but I like any car with a [b]history</B>. The Fiero and the Corvette are two of the best looking sportscars ever made in the States.<BR>B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Right on.. I think the fiero and vette are truely awesome cars, heck I welcome the vette owners, I think that'd be something to get a get together with both fiero/vette I've never rode in one yet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000069||fieroX||12-02-2001||11:14 AM||||I think corvettes are alright.  the only flaw I see in the whole corvette world is the mentality of some owners.  I believe they think that because the corvette is the mecca of GM, their sh!t dont stink.  (now may I remind you that I see this in some owners, not all owners, but it just seems that the impression of those owners sticks in you mind).  These people believe that because they spent 50G's on a car they are unrivaled in performance.  <BR>In conclusion everyone has their opinions of their cars, and they prefer some cars over others.  If there was no variation of peoples preferences it would be pretty boring seeing the same model of car all over the road.  If I saw a thousand fieros on the street every day I wouldnt like fieros.  I like to be different and have things you dont see every day, but thats my preference.  If you like corvettes thats cool, this is America you are entitled to do whatever you want.  Why does there have to be rivalries, because it keeps things interesting, but thats also in human nature.  There is no reason to get all upset if someone likes a car that is different than yours.  Id imagine there are people in this world that are Pinto enthusiasts that hate both fieros and corvettes, and can come up with a thousand reasons why a pinto is better than both.  <BR>Next fall my little sister (who is 20) will be purchasing a Z06.  I tried to explain to her how my L67 will be when it is finished, but she has no conception of the situation.  She tells me how fast the Z06 is, and yeah for a factory car it is extremely fast, She wont mod it, it will stay totally stock until she sells it.  I cant wait to show her my taillights.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fierox.com/logo2small.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000070||FlatLine||12-02-2001||11:40 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>I'll tell you guys a little secret. I like Corvettes. I mean, I like them a lot. Of course I like Fieros much better but I like any car with a history. The Fiero and the Corvette are two of the best looking sportscars ever made in the States.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>pennock said this and i have to say what about the first and third generation camaros?<P>------------------<BR>Know me broken by my master<BR>Teach thee on child of love hereafter<BR>Into the flood again<BR>Same old trip it was back then<BR>So I made a big mistake<BR>Try to see it once my way<BR>Drifting body it's sole desertion<BR>Flying not yet quite the notion<BR>Am I wrong?<BR>Have I run too far to get home<BR>Have I gone?<BR>And left you here alone<BR>If I would, could you?<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000071||Jake_Dragon||12-02-2001||11:45 AM||||If someone would give me a new Vette for a few months I would be glad to compare the two.<BR>But to be fair I would also have to have a cherry Fiero, one that has seen Archie would be cool.<P>Ok everyone send me $5 and I will go get one myself.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/left.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CHSpiff_1.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/right.gif">              <BR>                  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gt2_3.GIF"> ||||reg||1
