Z||000073||GWH||12-02-2001||12:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B><BR>BTW ~ Since we have a few Corvette folks here now, Is it true that on the Z06 cars, the red hash marks are put on to harass Ferrari? The rumor is the Z06 car won the race but "rubbed a little paint" with a ferrari and the hash marks represent it.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Z06 doesn't have hash marks. The '96 Grand Sport does. The hash marks represent the 2 Daytona Lemans wins in the 60's beating Ferrari.<BR>By the way, nice forum. I've always liked Fieros. I used own an '89 Supercharged MR2. Sold it and bought the 'vette. Still miss that car.<P><P>------------------<BR>Gary<BR>CorvetteForum Wuname: &lt;B&gt;Violent Demon&lt;/B&gt;<BR>LT(jg). Hollywood<BR>Assistant Safety Officer <BR>USS CorvetteForum Y2K Gold Crew<BR>1984 Light Bronze Irid. <BR>Z-51<BR>3:07 gears<BR>MEMBER: Lone Star Corvette Club<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.corvetteforum.net/c5/vash/earlybrgld.gif"> ||||reg||1
