Z||000078||avengador1||12-02-2001||02:49 PM||||From what I saw Sloth85gt went to the Corvette forum half cocked. The first couple of replies he got were half decent, then he started calling them names, so they started to get more insulting and hung him out to dry. Never enter an argument without all the facts because you will not be able to bluff your way out. Remember that the majority of Corvette owners know little or any at all about our cars, after all they are 'vette owners and they don't share our interest in our car. Nor do they know it's potential. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
