Z||000098||DrDave||12-06-2001||11:25 PM||||     The reason I do what I do with cars, Is that "I" do it.  Any body can "buy" a neat car.  Or a Hot car.  I like to design and build "MY" car.   If something exceeds my ability, I still do the research into how I want my car done.  I pick out my cam (sometimes I don't pick quite the right one, so I have to do it again.)  I learned to dial in the cam, because you can really crank up the torque by retarding the cam.  Little things that are neat to know.<BR>     The Fiero is the neatest "do it yourself project car" I've ever seen.||||reg||1
